cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "scpark-network: Analysis pipeline for science-park proximity and academic co-authorship networks"
abstract: >-
  Full analysis pipeline for a study of pseudo-replication in affiliation-string
  networks: bibliometric extraction from OpenAlex, geocoding, micro-geographic
  science-park classification against a Wikidata ground truth, construction of
  naive and entity-resolved co-affiliation networks, and the fourteen-item
  reporting protocol with its robustness, permutation, equivalence and power
  analyses.
type: software
